      "function_role": "omission-policy-4th-passing-tone",
      "narrative": "Although the 4th is forbidden as a phrase-ending note on dominant 7th, it is permissible as a passing tone in motion. Chapter 16 p.54 reiterates: 'Be careful how you treat the 4th tone. Use it as a passing tone.' Chapter 19 p.65 confirms: 'Be careful when playing the 4th note of major or dominant scales. Treat it as a passing tone.'",
