      "chord_quality": "dom7",
      "function_role": "rhythmic-placement-downbeat-chord-tones",
      "narrative": "Strong beats should carry structurally important chord tones on dominant 7th chords. Chapter 8 p.28 specifies: 'Beats 1 and 3 seem to want roots, 3rd's, 5th's, 7th's and 9th's (b9's on dom.7th chords that resolve up a perfect fourth).'",
