      "function_role": "color-tone-pretty-notes",
      "narrative": "The tension-generating color tones most characteristic of minor chords/scales are the 4th, 6th, major 7th, and 9th. Chapter 7 p.25 specifies: 'The pretty notes for minor chords/scales are 4, 6, 7, and 9th. These notes create tension and should be used in the over-all tension-release process.'",
