      "chord_quality": "min7",
      "function_role": "harmonic-family-pure-minor-avoidance",
      "narrative": "The pure natural minor (Aeolian) scale is explicitly ranked last in preference among minor scale options and is rarely used. Chapter 15 p.53 states: 'In category #3, MINOR SCALE CHOICES, the PURE MINOR scale choice is not used very often. I have found the order of preference to be Dorian, Bebop, Melodic, Blues, Pentatonic, and then any of the remaining Minor scale choices.'",
